Package: skyeye
Architecture: any
Section: electronics
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: SkyEye ARM simulator
 SkyEye is an Open Source Simulator, which can simulate Atmel AT91,
 EP7312, cs89712, StrongARM(SA1100/SA1110), XScale PXA25x. Users can
 run Operating Systems such as Linux, uCLinux, uC/OS-II for ARM and
 can analyze or debug in source level.
